  ],
  "description": "<p>Companion code for Chapter 15 of <i>MATLAB for Civil Engineers: From Basics to Advanced Applications</i> (Springer, 2025, https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-84673-1).</p><p>Six reproducible case studies: a digital twin for bridge stress monitoring, structural health classification with leave-one-out validation, IoT structural monitoring with persistence-based alarms, genetic-algorithm traffic signal optimisation for Athens with closed-form verification, multi-objective design of a wastewater treatment plant, and worker detection and hazard identification on construction sites with a pre-trained ACF people detector. All examples are run automatically in GitHub Actions on MATLAB R2023b and the latest release.</p>",
